OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dull day throughout. Overcast
OL,6,Fwith spells of drizzle for most but
OL,7,Fparticularly over the mountains in the
OL,8,Fnorth. A brisk southwesterly breeze,
OL,9,Fespecially for northwestern coasts.
OL,10,FFeeling mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally mild and cloudy,
OL,13,Fand spells of drizzle still for
OL,14,Fnorthern mountains. Clear spells in
OL,15,Fthe east bring a risk of fog before
OL,16,Fdawn. Winds easing for a light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
