OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FBrighter than Monday but
OL,6,Fstill largely cloudy especially in the
OL,7,Fnorth later in the day. A risk of
OL,8,Fdrizzly showers for most, with more
OL,9,Fpersistent rain arriving overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,12,Fclearing then feeling cooler and more
OL,13,Fautumnal with sunny spells and
OL,14,Fshowers, mainly for northern coasts
OL,15,Fand mountains. Showers then easing
OL,16,Fthrough Thursday before unsettled
OL,17,Fweather returns on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
